      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm thinking about doing a solo trip to london soon and wanted some advice on where to actually stay. i really want to experience the diverse, vibrant parts of the city with lots of different cultures and food, but i'm also a bit nervous about safety being by myself. can you recommend some cool, diverse neighborhoods to check out, and also let me know which areas are a bit too sketchy or have high crime and i should probably avoid? thanks!",
